WEBVTT

01:28.571 --> 01:32.451
Our Secret
EP03

01:38.521 --> 01:39.611
Make her happy.

01:41.690 --> 01:43.331
If you can make up, I'll concede you three points.

01:48.160 --> 01:50.440
Little Monster, you're a big man.

01:50.881 --> 01:52.011
I'm sorry.

01:57.881 --> 01:59.561
Never mind.

01:59.841 --> 02:00.971
Siyue, let's play basketball.

02:52.251 --> 02:53.371
Move to the left a little.

02:54.041 --> 02:54.961
You scared me.

02:56.931 --> 02:59.251
Well, but you can change with yours.

02:59.760 --> 03:00.561
Probably not gonna happen.

03:00.731 --> 03:02.601
I'll think about it.

03:05.201 --> 03:06.891
You're so nice, Little Monster.

03:07.121 --> 03:09.011
You not only didn't get upset,
but give chocolate to me.

03:10.371 --> 03:12.121
It's for Shadi.

03:13.041 --> 03:14.371
Thanks, Ding Xian.

03:14.731 --> 03:15.681
Here you are.

03:16.171 --> 03:18.371
Little Princess,
give me a piece of it, will you?

03:18.601 --> 03:20.201
Now you call me princess.

03:20.401 --> 03:21.321
What were you doing before?

03:21.451 --> 03:22.121
No.

03:22.321 --> 03:23.201
We've been known for many years.

03:23.371 --> 03:24.841
It's no big deal to
have a piece of chocolate.

03:25.010 --> 03:25.841
No.

03:26.961 --> 03:28.891
Haojie, have some chocolate.

03:29.091 --> 03:29.651
Thanks, Shadi.

03:29.760 --> 03:31.401
Little Monster, may I get one?

03:31.731 --> 03:32.681
Sure.

03:36.561 --> 03:37.760
Xianxian, here you are.

03:44.010 --> 03:46.010
Xianxian, getting along with classmate

03:46.201 --> 03:47.451
should be step by step.

03:47.760 --> 03:48.731
As time goes by,

03:48.931 --> 03:49.931
you'll find everyone

03:50.091 --> 03:51.291
can be so nice.

03:54.201 --> 03:55.171
Here you are.

04:03.891 --> 04:05.651
No snacks in classroom.

04:07.041 --> 04:07.931
Really?

04:08.321 --> 04:09.041
Why did I see you

04:09.201 --> 04:11.451
eat Bugles the other day?

04:11.651 --> 04:13.201
It's in Article 11 of the campus code.

04:13.731 --> 04:15.681
Ding Xian, haven't you seen it?

04:15.891 --> 04:17.721
Come on, who would?

04:18.371 --> 04:19.200
That's right.

04:21.001 --> 04:21.811
Besides,

04:21.971 --> 04:22.971
even if you want to eat chocolate,

04:23.131 --> 04:24.481
you can't eat this kind, either.

04:24.691 --> 04:25.691
What I have at home

04:25.851 --> 04:26.971
are all imported.

04:27.481 --> 04:29.251
Siyue, if you want,

04:29.411 --> 04:30.531
I'll bring you some tomorrow.

04:35.761 --> 04:37.411
Why do you eat this?

04:38.931 --> 04:40.281
I'm a little hypoglycemia.

04:49.201 --> 04:50.090
I'll go back.

04:50.281 --> 04:51.811
-Bye.  -Bye.

05:10.321 --> 05:11.251
Siyue

05:12.281 --> 05:13.201
Where's your bike?

05:13.281 --> 05:14.811
-I didn't ride.  -Why?

05:15.571 --> 05:16.761
Why so many questions?

05:18.651 --> 05:19.651
Wait, wait.

05:19.971 --> 05:20.881
There's another one.

05:21.601 --> 05:22.481
I found that

05:22.811 --> 05:25.411
you've been noticing
Little Monster a little more lately.

05:26.411 --> 05:27.721
We're classmates,

05:28.001 --> 05:29.601
and both families knew each other.

05:29.761 --> 05:31.131
So I take care of her,
what's the matter?

05:31.601 --> 05:32.531
Nah.

05:33.571 --> 05:34.721
Something is wrong.

05:34.971 --> 05:35.971
There's a story.

05:36.371 --> 05:37.531
You have something wrong.

05:38.651 --> 05:40.411
Do you go to the game center on Saturday?

05:45.531 --> 05:46.441
Xianxian

05:47.001 --> 05:48.371
Do me a favor to pick up your brother

05:48.371 --> 05:49.321
at the Hobby Group.

05:50.721 --> 05:52.090
If you can't find him around here,

05:52.090 --> 05:53.481
get him at the game center.

05:53.601 --> 05:54.571
He must be there.

05:54.721 --> 05:55.931
Game center again?

05:55.971 --> 05:57.251
It's okay to
have a little fun on the weekend.

05:57.411 --> 05:58.571
Hurry up.

05:58.761 --> 06:00.411
How did I forget?

06:00.761 --> 06:01.691
Hurry!

06:11.441 --> 06:13.161
Ding Juncong, go home.

06:13.481 --> 06:14.481
One more round.

06:15.001 --> 06:16.281
One more?

06:16.691 --> 06:17.691
You don't agree?

06:17.851 --> 06:19.371
Then I'll tell mom

06:19.531 --> 06:20.441
you hit me.

06:20.761 --> 06:21.851
I hit you?

06:22.441 --> 06:23.201
Ding Juncong

06:23.931 --> 06:24.691
You've got something, right?

06:24.691 --> 06:26.091
Hurt!

06:26.091 --> 06:27.281
Help! She's gonna sell me!

06:27.281 --> 06:28.161
I'm your sister!

06:28.161 --> 06:30.131
Hurt! Let me go! Hurt!

06:30.321 --> 06:30.881
Xianxian

06:30.881 --> 06:31.761
Help!

06:32.251 --> 06:33.411
Aren't you Little Pepper?

06:35.601 --> 06:36.851
No, no, I'm kidding.

06:36.851 --> 06:37.851
Don't take it seriously.

06:39.531 --> 06:40.531
I'm getting the coins.

06:45.041 --> 06:46.281
Move back on Monday.

06:51.131 --> 06:53.041
I was planned to call you

06:53.041 --> 06:54.090
to join us last night.

06:54.441 --> 06:55.971
But I realized
I don't have your number.

06:56.201 --> 06:57.571
Remember to give it to me next time.

06:59.971 --> 07:00.971
Ding Xian

07:01.131 --> 07:02.721
Let's switch seats back on Monday.

07:03.001 --> 07:04.761
I didn't mean to grab
your seat last time.

07:05.091 --> 07:06.161
Don't get angry.

07:06.881 --> 07:09.131
And Siyue told me about it.

07:10.881 --> 07:12.281
About what?

07:12.481 --> 07:14.371
He said you have a poor foundation.

07:14.721 --> 07:15.281
If you sit at the back of the classroom,

07:15.441 --> 07:17.001
he can help you with your homework.

07:17.571 --> 07:19.571
And he said I should be responsible

07:19.931 --> 07:21.201
as the class leader.

07:22.571 --> 07:23.571
Then that's it.

07:23.721 --> 07:24.651
We switch back on Monday.

07:24.811 --> 07:26.091
I'll get you guys something to eat.

07:29.001 --> 07:29.971
Coins ready.

07:34.131 --> 07:35.651
Let's go challenge.

07:39.851 --> 07:40.811
What are you doing here?

07:41.651 --> 07:42.651
Go and play.

07:45.761 --> 07:47.601
Who said I have a bad foundation?

07:48.691 --> 07:49.851
It's up to you.

07:50.481 --> 07:52.371
Whether you want to move back

07:52.971 --> 07:55.041
or still be deskmate with He Xingwen.

07:56.601 --> 07:56.971
You...

07:56.971 --> 07:58.041
You're welcome.

08:02.041 --> 08:03.001
Kid

08:03.161 --> 08:04.001
Thanks, brother.

08:05.721 --> 08:06.691
Let's go.

08:08.811 --> 08:10.091
Hurry up.

08:17.721 --> 08:18.881
Uncontested top dog.

08:20.441 --> 08:22.001
Didn't you just win a few rounds,

08:22.131 --> 08:23.131
what's the big deal.

08:24.531 --> 08:25.411
Little Monster

08:26.001 --> 08:26.881
Dance with me.

08:27.481 --> 08:28.281
I don't dance with him.

08:28.811 --> 08:29.761
Come on, I'll do with you.

08:29.761 --> 08:30.571
I don't know how...

08:30.931 --> 08:31.851
It's okay, come on.

08:31.971 --> 08:32.851
I really don't know.

08:33.041 --> 08:33.451
Come on!

08:33.451 --> 08:34.281
Have a try.

08:34.931 --> 08:35.961
Try it.

08:35.961 --> 08:36.720
Come on.

08:37.451 --> 08:38.281
I really can't.

08:38.281 --> 08:39.571
Take him down.

09:05.521 --> 09:06.811
Song, you can't make it.

09:07.011 --> 09:07.931
Don't worry.

09:34.841 --> 09:36.011
Awesome.

09:37.281 --> 09:38.211
I'm not convinced.

09:38.211 --> 09:39.211
One more round.

09:40.211 --> 09:41.771
If you lose, you lose.

09:41.771 --> 09:42.521
Big deal.

09:42.641 --> 09:44.211
Let's go and catch doll.

09:44.571 --> 09:45.641
Come on, let's go.

09:52.011 --> 09:52.931
What?

09:54.811 --> 09:55.771
That one is pretty.

09:58.841 --> 10:00.081
The bunny is cute.

10:00.841 --> 10:02.011
Nah, I prefer this pig.

10:03.601 --> 10:05.281
I like that one.

10:07.011 --> 10:09.211
Are you a girl?

10:10.081 --> 10:11.401
It's really cute.

10:11.401 --> 10:12.131
Come on, come on.

10:12.451 --> 10:13.451
You play with her.

10:13.721 --> 10:14.891
She is acting up today,

10:15.601 --> 10:16.371
winning me all the time.

10:16.371 --> 10:17.251
Boring.

10:17.721 --> 10:18.841
Are you scared?

10:23.691 --> 10:24.641
What do you want to compete?

10:24.841 --> 10:25.641
On what?

10:25.841 --> 10:27.601
Here, catching dolls.

10:29.161 --> 10:30.131
After you.

10:31.601 --> 10:33.521
Which one do you want?

10:34.371 --> 10:35.161
This one.

10:47.691 --> 10:50.211
Awesome, Siyue.

10:54.371 --> 10:55.571
Wanwan, which one?

10:55.571 --> 10:56.011
This one.

10:56.811 --> 10:57.451
OK.

11:09.841 --> 11:11.251
Sorry, Wanwan.

11:11.371 --> 11:12.211
Come on.

11:24.771 --> 11:25.841
Which one do you want?

11:27.211 --> 11:28.451
I'll do it myself.

11:41.211 --> 11:42.841
Sister, you're not good at this.

11:43.011 --> 11:44.451
Just let Brother Siyue catch it for you.

11:46.891 --> 11:47.691
That's it today.

11:47.891 --> 11:49.331
I'll take him home first.

11:49.641 --> 11:50.641
Come on, let's go.

11:52.161 --> 11:53.131
Gone?

11:59.841 --> 12:01.011
We're back.

12:01.481 --> 12:02.451
Ok.

12:02.601 --> 12:04.161
Wash your hands for dinner.

12:22.401 --> 12:23.811
How are you doing at school?

12:25.451 --> 12:26.451
Quite good.

12:26.961 --> 12:27.891
Help your brother with his math

12:28.131 --> 12:30.251
if you're free tonight.

12:33.811 --> 12:34.771
Well, mom,

12:35.771 --> 12:37.641
I want a phone.

12:41.721 --> 12:43.401
My classmate asked
me for my phone number,

12:43.601 --> 12:44.521
but I don't have one.

12:45.331 --> 12:47.081
Not study hard at this age,

12:47.081 --> 12:48.691
but contact for nothing.

12:48.891 --> 12:50.281
A new one is expensive,

12:50.481 --> 12:51.841
and I don't have money.

12:52.041 --> 12:53.451
But you didn't oppose Ding Juncong

12:54.081 --> 12:55.891
going to the game center.

12:57.371 --> 12:59.331
He's kid. Why compare to him?

12:59.641 --> 13:00.601
Just finish eating.

13:08.481 --> 13:09.251
Mr. Liu

13:09.401 --> 13:11.251
Siyue, why don't you go in?

13:11.641 --> 13:14.451
Mr. Liu, I want to talk to
you about something.

13:14.601 --> 13:15.601
Go ahead.

13:16.131 --> 13:18.481
Can you switch Ding Xian back to be my deskmate?

13:19.891 --> 13:21.011
Zhou Siyue

13:21.211 --> 13:22.811
You're only a freshman in high school.

13:23.041 --> 13:25.371
You should still focus on your studies.

13:26.601 --> 13:27.691
I know.

13:27.811 --> 13:28.771
Then tell me

13:28.961 --> 13:31.601
why you want to be
deskmate with Ding Xian?

13:32.481 --> 13:33.721
Morning, Ding Xian.

13:33.811 --> 13:35.841
Morning, is there still
a free breakfast today?

13:36.641 --> 13:37.641
Nah.

13:37.961 --> 13:38.721
Alright.

13:41.571 --> 13:42.451
Switch seats.

13:45.281 --> 13:47.131
You're moving back?

13:48.721 --> 13:50.641
So many books.
Let me help you with that.

13:51.371 --> 13:52.401
Okay.

13:55.161 --> 13:56.281
I found

13:57.081 --> 13:59.641
Liu Xiaofeng had some thoughts.

14:00.931 --> 14:03.131
You're the only one in the class who has some thoughts.

14:03.691 --> 14:05.401
It's not fair to say that. We're similar.

14:06.481 --> 14:08.691
Didn't you help Little Monster
change seats?

14:09.211 --> 14:10.451
How did you do that?

14:12.641 --> 14:13.721
It goes like this.

14:14.011 --> 14:16.331
Mr. Ding answered questions for me before.

14:16.721 --> 14:18.161
And Ding Xian has few friends

14:18.331 --> 14:19.601
in our class.

14:20.011 --> 14:20.841
I help her

14:21.011 --> 14:22.811
for repaying Mr. Ding.

14:23.601 --> 14:25.281
Repaying Mr. Ding?

14:26.281 --> 14:27.961
Do you think I'll buy that?

14:33.401 --> 14:34.521
Who are you still waiting?

14:35.771 --> 14:36.601
-Mr. Ding  -Mr. Liu

14:36.771 --> 14:37.811
Mr. Ding, morning.

14:37.961 --> 14:38.891
Morning.

14:39.601 --> 14:42.281
Siyue, those questions you asked a few days ago,

14:42.571 --> 14:43.571
have you understood?

14:44.131 --> 14:45.131
I got them.

14:45.571 --> 14:47.811
Siyue really worked hard.

14:48.251 --> 14:49.161
It'll be good if Xianxian

14:49.331 --> 14:51.281
can learn from you.

14:52.721 --> 14:54.371
I was just talking about
this with Mr. Liu that

14:54.691 --> 14:56.041
if Ding Xian can be

14:56.211 --> 14:57.161
my deskmate again.

14:58.251 --> 15:00.841
Ding Xian's liberal arts
performance is better

15:01.011 --> 15:02.841
and she can help me.

15:03.211 --> 15:03.931
That's good.

15:04.161 --> 15:06.011
Then you two be deskmate

15:06.161 --> 15:07.251
and learn from each other.

15:07.691 --> 15:08.771
Great.

15:09.451 --> 15:11.451
Mr. Liu, sorry to bother you.

15:12.211 --> 15:12.451
Yeah.

15:12.451 --> 15:13.331
Thank you, thank you.

15:13.481 --> 15:15.041
Well, for study.

15:15.251 --> 15:16.281
Absolutely right.

15:16.811 --> 15:17.961
-I'm leaving first.  -Okay.

15:18.721 --> 15:19.721
Hurry to class.

15:20.571 --> 15:21.691
Mr. Liu, thanks.

15:21.691 --> 15:22.131
Never mind.

15:22.891 --> 15:23.931
Xianxian

15:24.251 --> 15:25.371
Wonderful.

15:26.011 --> 15:27.081
See you.

15:35.961 --> 15:37.081
You're back.

15:43.331 --> 15:44.771
Xianxian, it's for you.

15:46.131 --> 15:47.161
You got it!

15:47.371 --> 15:48.771
It wasn't me.

15:49.131 --> 15:51.721
It's your deskmate.
He let me give it to you.

15:53.891 --> 15:55.161
Let's go for the class.

15:55.451 --> 15:56.401
Go.

16:00.481 --> 16:02.771
You're welcome, not a big deal.

16:03.891 --> 16:05.161
Why?

16:06.251 --> 16:07.771
Kong Shadi and others all have,

16:08.571 --> 16:10.371
so I grab one for you.

16:12.771 --> 16:14.721
You're so well considered,

16:14.961 --> 16:16.251
such a considerate guy.

16:18.131 --> 16:19.211
Give it back if you don't want it.

16:20.041 --> 16:21.691
Why not?

16:22.081 --> 16:23.721
Give it to me.

16:49.371 --> 16:50.371
Here.

16:51.281 --> 16:53.251
I don't want an ugly
little dinosaur like that.

16:55.371 --> 16:56.451
It's not, and besides,

16:56.601 --> 16:58.011
it's an alligator.

16:58.451 --> 16:59.961
It's a dinosaur.

17:00.521 --> 17:02.371
It looks exactly like you.

17:02.571 --> 17:03.931
No personal attacks.

17:04.081 --> 17:05.000
A dinosaur.

17:05.161 --> 17:05.851
An alligator.

17:06.000 --> 17:06.931
Definitely a dinosaur.

17:07.241 --> 17:08.611
Definitely an alligator.

17:11.931 --> 17:12.571
Look,

17:12.931 --> 17:14.491
baby dinosaur.

17:19.401 --> 17:20.491
From now on,

17:20.641 --> 17:21.971
I'm your owner.

17:22.121 --> 17:23.331
I say you're an alligator,

17:23.491 --> 17:25.361
then you're an alligator.

17:34.611 --> 17:36.971
You two are taking
so long. Class begins!

17:37.571 --> 17:38.491
Coming.

17:43.001 --> 17:44.211
Dear diary,

17:45.161 --> 17:47.691
the bad high school life I thought

17:48.521 --> 17:50.641
is getting better.

18:05.571 --> 18:08.241
What a gap between people...

18:12.041 --> 18:13.001
What're you looking at?

18:15.281 --> 18:16.281
I was thinking

18:16.731 --> 18:18.761
why people need to learn math.

18:19.241 --> 18:20.571
Would we use the function

18:20.761 --> 18:22.241
to figure the equation when shopping?

18:24.451 --> 18:25.851
Maybe it's for

18:26.001 --> 18:27.881
blowing the poor students like us.

18:42.851 --> 18:44.641
Deskmate, the situation there is rather severe.

18:48.241 --> 18:49.211
Never mind.

18:49.691 --> 18:51.611
I'm a salted fish anyway,

18:52.361 --> 18:54.281
no big goals.

18:54.521 --> 18:56.641
And I never thought about going to a key university.

18:59.241 --> 19:00.211
My goal

19:00.491 --> 19:02.641
is to go to a university
in other province.

19:03.851 --> 19:05.281
Other province?

19:08.161 --> 19:09.731
I wanna go to Hangzhou.

19:12.931 --> 19:13.811
Hangzhou

19:14.571 --> 19:15.571
is good.

19:16.571 --> 19:17.571
It's a beautiful city.

19:17.811 --> 19:19.001
You've been there?

19:19.211 --> 19:20.571
Have you ever seen the West Lake?

19:20.851 --> 19:22.611
And the Leifeng Pagoda,

19:22.811 --> 19:24.521
as well as Broken Bridge
besides the West Lake.

19:25.161 --> 19:26.571
You watched Tale of the
White Snake too much.

19:36.361 --> 19:36.931
Tale of the White Snake

19:37.091 --> 19:38.571
You know, you could have asked me.

19:41.001 --> 19:43.001
You don't even listen to the class.

19:43.161 --> 19:45.241
Do you know what I said if I do?

19:46.091 --> 19:48.161
I'm better than you
even I didn't listen.

19:48.401 --> 19:49.451
Give me your test paper.

19:56.161 --> 19:58.401
The most important thing in math
is the thought to figure it out.

19:59.881 --> 20:00.931
Like this question,

20:01.851 --> 20:04.121
we know that tan α is two.

20:04.281 --> 20:05.121
So we can find out

20:05.281 --> 20:07.811
Sin α is equal to twice cos α.

20:08.001 --> 20:09.691
So substitute it into this formula,

20:10.121 --> 20:12.091
we can figure out sin α times cos α

20:12.331 --> 20:13.641
is equal to two fifth.

20:19.451 --> 20:20.521
Why are you laughing?

20:20.881 --> 20:22.001
Write it down.

20:30.571 --> 20:32.091
So you didn't listen to me, did you?

20:32.241 --> 20:33.001
Yes, I did.

20:33.161 --> 20:34.001
So what did I say?

20:34.161 --> 20:35.041
You said...

20:37.521 --> 20:38.811
You really are a salted fish

20:39.211 --> 20:40.611
and can remember nothing.

20:41.001 --> 20:42.571
I don't know how you got in this school.

20:44.121 --> 20:45.971
I know a really great guy.

20:46.161 --> 20:48.041
It was him who encouraged me here.

20:50.241 --> 20:51.571
Some senior

20:52.881 --> 20:54.521
having lunch with you, right?

20:55.761 --> 20:59.161
I didn't get good grades
when I was a kid.

20:59.451 --> 21:00.211
Other kids

21:00.361 --> 21:01.931
knew all 26 letters by heart so early.

21:02.091 --> 21:03.761
I did it for a month.

21:05.331 --> 21:07.811
Then I met Su Bocong.

21:09.121 --> 21:10.611
He told me

21:12.161 --> 21:14.331
there's nothing that others can do

21:14.521 --> 21:15.521
but you can't.

21:16.451 --> 21:17.401
If you can't,

21:18.211 --> 21:19.931
that means you didn't work harder.

21:23.211 --> 21:24.121
Believe it or not,

21:24.281 --> 21:26.001
there is something in what he said.

21:26.931 --> 21:27.971
Because of his words,

21:28.121 --> 21:29.731
I know that a slow sparrow
should make an early start.

21:29.881 --> 21:31.091
If it took others one hour,

21:31.491 --> 21:33.331
then I would spend two hours on it.

21:34.281 --> 21:35.331
So you stay up late to 2 or 3 a.m

21:35.491 --> 21:37.001
every night,

21:37.211 --> 21:38.811
and have no energy
in class during the day?

21:41.971 --> 21:43.691
You think everyone is like you?

21:43.931 --> 21:45.331
Just need to look at it once
and memorize them all?

21:47.001 --> 21:48.401
The gap between individuals

21:48.571 --> 21:49.971
is actually not wide.

21:50.241 --> 21:51.401
The problems you met

21:51.571 --> 21:53.491
are because of your method.

21:58.211 --> 21:59.331
Look at your note.

21:59.761 --> 22:01.001
Didn't I tell you

22:01.161 --> 22:02.691
to write down the important
things when taking notes.

22:04.001 --> 22:04.761
You wrote everything down here.

22:04.971 --> 22:06.121
How can you recite all these?

22:06.331 --> 22:08.121
I'll be surprised if you got a high score.

22:12.041 --> 22:12.971
Then

22:14.001 --> 22:15.241
please give me your
advice in the future.

22:16.241 --> 22:17.241
It's up to you.

22:19.331 --> 22:21.611
Please help me with this one again.

22:31.761 --> 22:32.851
Dinner is ready!

22:33.811 --> 22:36.881
Ding Xian, take out your note.

22:45.521 --> 22:46.691
Xianxian, come for dinner.

22:57.451 --> 22:58.491
Ding Xian

22:58.691 --> 23:00.881
Why are you making fewer notes?

23:01.041 --> 23:02.521
Do you not study hard?

23:02.691 --> 23:05.451
Mom, it's called sticking to the point.

23:05.811 --> 23:07.571
What point?

23:07.931 --> 23:09.331
You're just slacking off.

23:09.491 --> 23:10.521
I didn't.

23:12.001 --> 23:14.971
Mom, the way how you think about learning

23:15.121 --> 23:16.491
is out of date.

23:18.571 --> 23:20.121
Exactly, making notes in this way

23:20.401 --> 23:21.881
is really clearer.

23:24.881 --> 23:25.491
Stop reading.

23:25.691 --> 23:27.041
Dinner first.

23:29.641 --> 23:32.851
That's what Zhou Siyue told me.

23:33.571 --> 23:35.731
Then you need to learn from him.

23:36.931 --> 23:38.611
So do I.

23:40.931 --> 23:42.241
Dad, mom,

23:42.641 --> 23:44.571
I was elected class leader.

23:45.331 --> 23:46.451
Class leader?

23:47.241 --> 23:48.521
It's good.

23:48.691 --> 23:49.851
My son is great.

23:50.361 --> 23:51.881
You're an honor to me.

23:51.971 --> 23:52.691
I'll buy you snacks

23:52.851 --> 23:54.361
later.

23:55.761 --> 23:59.161
It seems that our class
will also elect class cadres.

23:59.361 --> 24:00.211
Really?

24:00.361 --> 24:02.641
So which position
do you want to run, Xianxian?

24:04.971 --> 24:05.851
No idea.

24:06.001 --> 24:07.361
Will it influence your study?

24:07.571 --> 24:08.611
Nah.

24:09.281 --> 24:10.571
You know what, Xianxian?

24:11.001 --> 24:12.281
You're good at painting.

24:12.491 --> 24:14.241
You're more than enough to be
a commissary of literature and art.

24:14.611 --> 24:16.161
I think your painting

24:16.161 --> 24:18.001
can represent the school
to take part in match.

24:18.161 --> 24:19.091
Am I right?

24:19.331 --> 24:20.811
My sister is a big coward.

24:20.971 --> 24:22.121
She won't run for that.

24:22.881 --> 24:24.001
Who said that?

24:24.161 --> 24:24.971
You're a big coward.

24:25.161 --> 24:26.091
You're a big coward.

24:26.211 --> 24:26.971
Alright, alright.

24:27.211 --> 24:28.971
Go for it, you have to.

24:29.641 --> 24:31.451
If Xianxian makes it,

24:31.931 --> 24:34.121
we'll have two cadres in our family.

24:35.611 --> 24:36.691
Good.

24:51.571 --> 24:52.611
Here, the breakfast.

25:05.691 --> 25:06.731
When did you go to bed last night?

25:08.361 --> 25:09.241
One o'clock.

25:11.121 --> 25:12.041
You?

25:13.041 --> 25:14.041
Three.

25:16.761 --> 25:18.091
You worked so hard.

25:19.211 --> 25:20.211
I didn't.

25:21.001 --> 25:22.611
I was playing video games all night.

25:26.401 --> 25:27.611
That's the way you are.

25:30.571 --> 25:31.851
Can you walk a little faster?

25:32.161 --> 25:33.241
Are you a snail?

25:34.241 --> 25:36.491
My bag is too heavy.

25:37.971 --> 25:40.091
Who let you put all

25:40.211 --> 25:41.401
the teaching materials in it?

25:41.571 --> 25:42.611
It's heavy, of course.

25:58.691 --> 25:59.691
Hurry.

26:06.281 --> 26:08.001
We're at school, and I'll do it myself.

26:12.491 --> 26:13.331
Hurry up.

26:16.331 --> 26:17.361
Siyue

26:18.881 --> 26:19.971
Long time no see.

26:20.121 --> 26:21.161
You healed up?

26:21.331 --> 26:22.691
Yeah, but...

26:22.931 --> 26:24.361
I missed a lot on my study.

26:24.761 --> 26:25.881
You can do it.

26:26.611 --> 26:28.761
Thanks, see you later.

26:31.401 --> 26:33.401
She's the girl

26:33.571 --> 26:35.001
who asked for leave in our class?

26:35.931 --> 26:36.811
Yang Chunzi

26:37.041 --> 26:37.491
Siyue

26:38.611 --> 26:39.691
Isn't she Yang Chunzi?

26:40.641 --> 26:42.161
She got prettier than
she was in junior high school.

26:45.971 --> 26:47.331
Why do I think Zhou Siyue and you

26:47.491 --> 26:48.641
are a little different?

26:48.851 --> 26:50.001
He even took bag for you.

26:51.241 --> 26:51.811
No...

26:51.971 --> 26:53.761
It's because my bag is too heavy.

27:12.491 --> 27:14.641
I really want to be deskmate
with Yang Chunzi.

27:18.281 --> 27:18.851
What did you say?

27:18.851 --> 27:19.451
It hurt!

27:20.571 --> 27:22.281
I said I really want to be
deskmate with you.

27:24.971 --> 27:25.811
Is it?

27:26.121 --> 27:26.971
Why did I hear that

27:27.241 --> 27:30.241
you really want to be
deskmate with Yang Chunzi?

27:30.401 --> 27:31.361
No, you must have imagined it.

27:31.521 --> 27:33.971
How could it be?
You're way better than her.

27:35.281 --> 27:36.281
No, no, no, hurt, hurt.

27:36.281 --> 27:37.091
Still not telling the truth?

27:37.521 --> 27:38.401
I will.

27:38.971 --> 27:40.571
Yang Chunzi is

27:40.691 --> 27:42.041
good at study and everyone likes her.

27:42.041 --> 27:42.731
And she's pretty...

27:42.731 --> 27:43.161
Nah...

27:43.331 --> 27:44.691
Why are you pulling hard
when I'm telling the truth?

27:44.851 --> 27:45.851
I just want to hear the truth.

27:46.001 --> 27:46.971
Keep talking.

27:47.361 --> 27:48.761
Let me go and listen to me.

27:49.811 --> 27:50.811
That...

27:51.491 --> 27:52.491
Though everyone likes her,

27:52.491 --> 27:53.811
it's not my business.

27:54.401 --> 27:55.491
Well, you know,

27:55.881 --> 27:56.761
in junior high school,

27:56.971 --> 27:58.241
she was close to Siyue.

27:58.571 --> 27:59.691
Right, Siyue?

28:01.851 --> 28:02.691
Don't you remember?

28:03.361 --> 28:04.121
In the middle school,

28:04.281 --> 28:06.091
they made fun of you two
as a golden couple.

28:06.611 --> 28:07.811
Boring.

28:11.611 --> 28:12.761
Don't be mad.

28:16.851 --> 28:17.761
What are you thinking?

28:19.571 --> 28:20.521
Nothing.

28:26.001 --> 28:27.571
Chunzi, here.

28:29.641 --> 28:30.641
Show off.

28:33.361 --> 28:35.041
Envy makes a girl ugly.

28:35.971 --> 28:37.001
Really?

28:40.611 --> 28:41.811
You're not jealous?

28:42.041 --> 28:43.761
She's sitting next to Zhou Siyue.

28:44.401 --> 28:45.611
Why do I care?

28:51.121 --> 28:52.091
Well,

28:52.641 --> 28:53.521
does everyone like

28:53.691 --> 28:55.001
girls like her?

28:56.691 --> 28:59.641
Maybe, probably.

29:03.521 --> 29:04.451
But honestly,

29:04.691 --> 29:06.691
I think you look much better
than she does if you dress up.

29:08.331 --> 29:09.241
For sure.

29:09.451 --> 29:10.361
You just

29:10.761 --> 29:12.641
have a high forehead.

29:12.811 --> 29:14.401
Why don't you try bangs?

29:14.401 --> 29:14.971
What do you think?

29:14.971 --> 29:17.001
I can't. My mom told me my fortune.

29:17.241 --> 29:18.211
I can become an official
because of this forehead.

29:18.361 --> 29:19.211
I can't get it covered.

29:19.331 --> 29:21.211
Oh, no, you believe that?

29:21.521 --> 29:22.451
Well, hurry to eat.

29:22.611 --> 29:24.161
I have to run for the
election this afternoon.

29:25.611 --> 29:27.761
Well, sounds like you're
going to sign up.

29:29.091 --> 29:30.331
I wanna try.

29:31.761 --> 29:32.761
Stand up.

29:34.281 --> 29:36.971
Good afternoon, sir.

29:37.331 --> 29:38.281
Sit down, please.

29:40.691 --> 29:42.731
It's been a while since school was started.

29:43.281 --> 29:44.571
You've all got used to

29:44.731 --> 29:46.211
high school, haven't you?

29:46.851 --> 29:47.641
Next,

29:47.851 --> 29:50.001
there will be many activities at school

29:50.161 --> 29:52.361
that need people to
organize and manage.

29:52.691 --> 29:53.641
Our class

29:53.881 --> 29:56.001
is going to elect cadres today.

29:56.761 --> 29:58.611
First, the class leader.

29:59.041 --> 30:01.401
It had been represented by Deng Wanwan.

30:01.971 --> 30:04.001
Does anyone else want to sign up now?

30:05.571 --> 30:06.331
Classmates

30:06.491 --> 30:07.091
I've been a represented class leader

30:07.241 --> 30:08.281
for a while.

30:08.491 --> 30:10.331
And I've been doing
my best for everyone.

30:10.491 --> 30:12.091
I hope you can elect me
an official class leader.

30:12.401 --> 30:13.451
Thank you all.

30:14.811 --> 30:16.971
Bravo.

30:20.281 --> 30:21.451
Commissary in charge of studies

30:24.731 --> 30:26.811
Zhou Siyue, how about you?

30:28.811 --> 30:30.211
Pass me, sir.

30:30.731 --> 30:31.761
Sorry about that.

30:32.931 --> 30:35.401
Then He Xingwen, I name you.

30:35.451 --> 30:36.401
I...

30:36.931 --> 30:37.851
...Okay.

30:38.931 --> 30:40.761
-Commissary in charge of sports  -Me.

30:41.691 --> 30:42.731
Sit!

30:43.041 --> 30:43.881
Can you let me do it?

30:44.041 --> 30:45.641
No, there should be justice and equity.

30:45.691 --> 30:47.091
You can borrow my
limited edition basketball.

30:47.091 --> 30:47.571
I...

30:48.851 --> 30:49.851
...trust you.

30:51.331 --> 30:52.491
Be at ease, everyone.

30:52.641 --> 30:55.121
I'll have fun with you in PE class.

31:01.811 --> 31:03.091
Commissary in charge of arts

31:04.401 --> 31:06.521
Does anyone want to sign up?

31:06.731 --> 31:08.091
Ding Xian, commissary in charge of arts.

31:08.241 --> 31:08.971
Go!

31:09.211 --> 31:10.851
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

31:13.451 --> 31:14.611
I'm Yang Chunzi.

31:15.281 --> 31:17.361
I like singing, dancing and drawing.

31:17.761 --> 31:18.641
I used to be the
commissary in charge of arts

31:18.811 --> 31:20.401
for three years in junior high school.

31:20.851 --> 31:22.121
If I am elected this time,

31:22.281 --> 31:24.361
I will be more strict with myself,

31:24.691 --> 31:26.571
serving everyone with all my heart

31:26.761 --> 31:28.761
and live up to everyone's expectations.

31:29.761 --> 31:31.041
Great!

31:33.931 --> 31:35.211
Good, Yang Chunzi.

31:35.931 --> 31:37.361
Here are some forms,

31:37.521 --> 31:39.361
hand them out after class.

31:39.931 --> 31:41.641
Everybody needs to fill it out

31:41.811 --> 31:42.761
the information

31:42.931 --> 31:43.811
and specialties of yours.

31:44.211 --> 31:46.361
Give it back to me
in the next two days, okay?

31:47.571 --> 31:50.611
Next, commissary in charge of
physical labor.

31:51.761 --> 31:53.521
Sir, I love to do manual labor
since childhood.

31:53.731 --> 31:54.931
My specialty is doing labor.

31:55.611 --> 31:57.451
Good, make good use of your strength.

31:57.611 --> 31:58.571
Thanks sir.

32:11.971 --> 32:13.451
Xiaofeng, have you finished?

32:16.041 --> 32:18.641
Xianxian, why did you
cross out your specialty?

32:19.241 --> 32:20.401
I saw your painting

32:20.641 --> 32:22.241
was quite good the other day.

32:22.611 --> 32:23.691
Mr. Marinated egg

32:25.641 --> 32:27.491
Why does this look familiar to me?

32:33.851 --> 32:35.851
Ding Xian, your painting is so great.

32:37.491 --> 32:39.761
But I also feel like it looks familiar.

32:42.041 --> 32:43.361
Ding Xian, are you interested in

32:43.521 --> 32:45.091
making blackboard newspaper
for our class with me?

32:47.121 --> 32:47.931
Okay.

32:48.161 --> 32:49.121
Great.

32:49.331 --> 32:50.851
The first theme of it is

32:51.001 --> 32:51.851
National Day in autumn.

32:52.041 --> 32:54.001
But it's due next week,

32:54.211 --> 32:56.211
so please make it after school this week.

32:56.691 --> 32:57.641
Okay.

32:57.691 --> 32:59.331
-Have you done?  -Yeah.

33:03.571 --> 33:04.571
Siyue

33:04.851 --> 33:05.761
Thanks.

33:08.691 --> 33:09.641
See you.

33:19.121 --> 33:20.211
Are you jealous

33:21.091 --> 33:23.041
now?

33:27.931 --> 33:28.971
Jealous?

33:30.971 --> 33:32.041
About what?

33:33.331 --> 33:34.331
Nothing.

33:35.571 --> 33:36.451
Nothing.

33:43.041 --> 33:44.731
You are really going to
paint board with her?

33:44.881 --> 33:47.041
Yeah, I said yes.

33:47.881 --> 33:49.611
She is such a hypocrite.

33:49.851 --> 33:50.691
If she bullies you,

33:50.851 --> 33:51.851
just tell me.

33:52.091 --> 33:53.451
I think she's good,

33:53.571 --> 33:55.091
so sweet.

33:55.521 --> 33:57.281
Hey, it's just manifestation.

33:57.491 --> 33:58.521
Manifestation, you know?

33:58.691 --> 34:00.241
If you had a haircut like her,

34:00.401 --> 34:02.161
and speak like she does,

34:02.361 --> 34:03.331
you're just like her.

34:04.121 --> 34:04.931
Just like this now.

34:05.121 --> 34:06.211
Kong Shadi

34:06.931 --> 34:08.211
You're starting to sound like her.

34:08.971 --> 34:11.531
Siyue, long time no see.

34:11.771 --> 34:12.360
Do it.

34:12.561 --> 34:13.880
No, I won't.

34:14.051 --> 34:14.840
Siyue

34:31.531 --> 34:32.601
You look good.

34:40.011 --> 34:41.081
She wore perfume.

34:41.251 --> 34:42.491
It's all your fault.

34:42.731 --> 34:43.691
For sure.

34:47.291 --> 34:48.451
Concede me three points today.

34:49.121 --> 34:50.121
Nice try.

34:51.691 --> 34:53.731
Or I'll help you make your
deskmate happy today,

34:54.011 --> 34:55.771
and then you concede me.

34:59.051 --> 34:59.881
Boring.

35:00.641 --> 35:01.691
Well, you're really...

35:01.841 --> 35:02.801
Zhou Siyue

35:03.801 --> 35:04.161
Let's go.

35:04.161 --> 35:05.051
Ding Xian

35:05.401 --> 35:07.291
We're gonna make blackboard this PE class.

35:07.451 --> 35:08.641
I have already asked leave
to the teacher.

35:11.121 --> 35:11.841
OK.

35:12.641 --> 35:13.691
Poor you.

35:13.931 --> 35:15.771
Then I'll go to watch them
playing basketball by myself.

35:16.051 --> 35:17.081
I have to.

35:17.561 --> 35:18.561
A lot of girls are going to

35:18.641 --> 35:20.531
watch them playing these days.

35:20.731 --> 35:22.931
Especially Siyue.

35:23.881 --> 35:24.931
I'm ok with that,

35:25.081 --> 35:26.451
why do I care.

35:28.011 --> 35:28.881
You're reluctant to admit.

35:29.081 --> 35:30.081
Bye. I gotta go.

35:32.161 --> 35:33.361
Xuanxuan, let's go.

35:33.561 --> 35:34.491
Coming.

35:35.321 --> 35:36.401
Let's start.

35:37.081 --> 35:39.081
Do you have an overall composition?

35:39.251 --> 35:40.931
We're running out of time.
Just paint whatever you want.

35:41.081 --> 35:42.691
I'll find some suitable
sentences to write.

35:42.881 --> 35:43.691
Okay.

35:49.691 --> 35:51.251
You can use mine.

35:51.561 --> 35:53.641
He doesn't like people
touching his stuff.

35:53.801 --> 35:55.451
It doesn't matter if it's me.

35:58.251 --> 36:00.401
It's quite a special relationship.

36:05.601 --> 36:06.531
What's up, Song?

36:06.691 --> 36:08.211
Those guys in Class 8
really get me annoyed.

36:08.401 --> 36:09.401
I'll beat them if I see them.

36:09.561 --> 36:10.531
Bad luck!

36:11.361 --> 36:14.121
All right, I'll figure it out
for you next weekend.

36:17.361 --> 36:18.251
By the way,

36:18.531 --> 36:20.401
is your robot competition
about to start?

36:22.771 --> 36:24.161
You know what I recalled?

36:25.051 --> 36:26.561
I thought of Yang Chunzi and you.

36:27.601 --> 36:29.161
You were really a good match.

36:29.321 --> 36:31.011
There's nothing you guys can't do.

36:32.251 --> 36:34.161
Now she came back to our class.

36:34.731 --> 36:36.801
Don't you have a little stir inside?

36:37.211 --> 36:38.801
Just stir?

36:39.691 --> 36:42.451
I think you have waves in your heart.

36:43.641 --> 36:44.401
No, no.

36:44.561 --> 36:46.011
I'm not a man for that sort of thing.

36:48.491 --> 36:49.841
Was that obvious?

36:50.971 --> 36:52.081
Yang Chunzi

36:52.251 --> 36:53.211
How dare you!

36:57.771 --> 36:59.691
Yang Chunzi, what are you doing?

36:59.881 --> 37:00.801
I'm making blackboard newspaper.

37:02.491 --> 37:03.451
You're back.

37:04.841 --> 37:05.561
You are slacking off.

37:05.561 --> 37:07.601
This is drawn by you, Little Monster?

37:07.801 --> 37:08.841
Nice!

37:09.051 --> 37:10.051
Who else?

37:11.801 --> 37:13.561
I noticed that ever since
you sat with Siyue,

37:13.731 --> 37:16.361
you're getting really bad-tempered.

37:20.251 --> 37:20.971
Yang Chunzi

37:21.561 --> 37:23.321
This must be drawn by you.

37:23.561 --> 37:25.161
No matter the color

37:25.321 --> 37:26.081
or the shape...

37:27.771 --> 37:28.841
Does it look good?

37:29.051 --> 37:29.801
What are you doing?

37:29.971 --> 37:31.011
What am I doing?

37:31.881 --> 37:33.731
Can't you learn from Yang Chunzi? You...

37:33.731 --> 37:34.561
-Why should I learn from her?  -Will you stop...

37:34.691 --> 37:35.531
... -beating me so frequently?  -What if I do it?

37:35.771 --> 37:36.841
I'm warning you not to beat me again.

38:01.801 --> 38:02.561
Xianxian

38:02.731 --> 38:04.011
Your, your face...

38:04.291 --> 38:05.641
Much better than usual, right?

38:05.841 --> 38:08.251
Yeah, looks like you're
wearing makeup. Look!

38:12.011 --> 38:12.971
Right?

38:15.601 --> 38:16.771
No!

38:17.211 --> 38:19.121
I was just trying to help you.

38:19.531 --> 38:20.531
You did it on purpose.

38:20.691 --> 38:21.881
You'll fall without my help.

38:21.971 --> 38:22.881
You did it on purpose, stop talking!

38:22.881 --> 38:24.641
That's the so-called flirting.

38:25.401 --> 38:26.291
I think so.

38:26.451 --> 38:27.251
Shut up!

38:47.121 --> 38:47.931
It's not...

39:00.211 --> 39:01.211
What are you laughing?

39:02.401 --> 39:04.361
Someone is cramming at the last minute.

39:05.771 --> 39:07.321
I can still cram,

39:08.081 --> 39:08.841
what about you?

39:09.051 --> 39:11.161
Have you recited the English text?

39:14.491 --> 39:15.491
How could it be possible?

39:15.691 --> 39:16.841
So many new words,

39:17.081 --> 39:18.561
and you recited all in one night?

39:19.361 --> 39:21.121
I didn't.

39:21.451 --> 39:22.971
Read it a few times and then I can.

39:24.841 --> 39:27.051
Yeah, I know you're ace.

39:31.161 --> 39:32.011
I'm running out of time.

39:32.211 --> 39:33.291
Give it to me.

39:37.731 --> 39:39.081
Are you reciting Chinese

39:39.291 --> 39:40.451
or English?

39:42.321 --> 39:43.121
Stop joking me.

39:43.291 --> 39:44.361
I'm not.

39:46.211 --> 39:47.841
You have to memorize
the phonetic symbols.

39:48.321 --> 39:50.531
No one remembers English
with Chinese characters.

39:51.291 --> 39:53.251
Leave me alone.

39:53.531 --> 39:55.161
It's good for me.

39:58.321 --> 39:59.211
Have you recited

39:59.361 --> 40:00.801
the text yet?

40:03.801 --> 40:05.641
Any volunteers?

40:08.401 --> 40:09.081
No one?

40:09.291 --> 40:10.601
I'm calling the roll.

40:11.881 --> 40:12.881
Ding Xian

40:13.641 --> 40:14.561
You first.

40:23.561 --> 40:25.211
My name is Wang Kun.

40:25.491 --> 40:27.251
Ever since middle school... I have...

40:32.401 --> 40:33.451
No laughing!

40:34.841 --> 40:37.251
You need to practice your
spoken English more.

40:37.491 --> 40:38.931
Recite it one more time to me later.

40:39.161 --> 40:40.011
Sit down.

40:41.881 --> 40:42.731
Yang Chunzi

40:42.931 --> 40:43.771
It's your turn.

40:45.771 --> 40:47.251
My name is Wang Kun.

40:47.731 --> 40:49.401
Ever since middle school,

40:50.211 --> 40:51.971
my sister Wang Wei and I have dreamed about

40:51.971 --> 40:55.051
taking a great bike trip.

41:07.601 --> 41:08.601
Xianxian

41:10.771 --> 41:12.051
Here are the English tutorial
you asked for.

41:14.211 --> 41:15.321
Thanks.

41:17.451 --> 41:19.051
The English teacher said
you had an accent?

41:23.731 --> 41:24.601
That's normal.

41:24.801 --> 41:25.451
When we were kids,

41:25.601 --> 41:27.321
we didn't pronounce ABCD well.

41:27.491 --> 41:29.731
Just follow the tape,
and read and practice more.

41:38.801 --> 41:40.401
What's on your mind?

41:44.361 --> 41:47.641
There is a girl in our class
who is brilliant.

41:48.251 --> 41:50.601
Good-looking, and studying well.

41:51.401 --> 41:53.211
Everyone likes her.

41:53.691 --> 41:54.561
Moreover,

41:55.601 --> 41:57.931
my deskmate seems to
care about her very much.

42:00.321 --> 42:02.291
So do you care about her

42:03.051 --> 42:04.731
or your deskmate?

42:07.011 --> 42:09.081
Your deskmate is a boy, isn't he?

42:10.121 --> 42:12.491
It's not like what you think.

42:12.971 --> 42:13.931
In adolescence,

42:14.081 --> 42:14.971
I can understand.

42:15.401 --> 42:18.121
No, we're just friends.

42:20.161 --> 42:22.081
Since when you start gossiping?

42:22.401 --> 42:23.771
Okay, I won't make fun of you.

42:24.881 --> 42:26.561
Come on. Let's go.

42:35.771 --> 42:36.771
Zhou Siyue

42:37.601 --> 42:38.641
Where's Ding Xian?

42:40.161 --> 42:41.691
She went to the restroom.

42:46.361 --> 42:48.691
Still asleep? Wake up.

43:05.211 --> 43:06.251
Where did you go?

43:07.971 --> 43:09.121
I'm not telling you.

43:10.211 --> 43:11.641
Now you can skip class?

43:12.601 --> 43:14.401
I can do many things.

43:16.211 --> 43:17.561
You really have something now.

43:21.251 --> 43:22.321
This is the English note.

43:22.491 --> 43:23.931
I re-wrote for you.

43:24.361 --> 43:25.971
Look what you wrote before.

43:26.211 --> 43:27.081
It's a wretched scrawl.

43:31.321 --> 43:32.291
Thanks!
